## Usage

Uses numerical surface values rather than GeoJSON polygon topology. Heatmap surfaceMode is the convenient choice when the same scalar data should also drive a colormap.

<Note title="SVG and PDF export">

**Image.** SVG and PDF exports draw a Surface as an image at the export's raster DPI, with all of its 3D view's marks, and `mode="vector"` refuses it. See [what is not exported as vector](/docs/export).

</Note>
